[gd_scene format=3]

; The Mantle, east of the Threshold (map offset (442, -175)): the first of the core, old machinery still turning. Great
; wheels turn in the dark behind a bronze piston seized over the way; the door on to the Orrery is high in the east wall. The way up needs
; both: Mag-grip climbs the piston, and the Harpoon crosses the air from its top along three rings to the door's ledge.

